// Arduino Wokwi Simulation (v0.5.0)
// Repo: https://github.com/YuchengCai/Skill-HardwarEasySim-Wokwi.git
// Triggers: arduino/wokwi/uno/单片机 keywords, .ino/wokwi.toml/diagram.json files, @wokwi @simulate

## Board Support

Uno/Mega/Nano/ESP32 — compile.sh auto-infers FQBN; ESP32 core auto-installs via CN mirror.

## Project Files

- wokwi.toml: MUST use [wokwi] section (version=1 + firmware='build/x.ino.hex'). [env]/[board] = error.
- Third-party libs: libraries.txt (one per line) + arduino-cli lib install before compile

## Workflow

入口选择: 有代码物证(.ino/sketch/libraries.txt) → Entry B: 按 references/arduino/code-mapping.json 反推元件与网表,清单须用户确认后才写 intent(多候选必问);纯需求描述 → 直接按下述设计。歧义时问一句。

1. Generate .ino + match references/arduino/index.json (zh) → components.md → detail/. Write layout-intent.json (no coords; contract references/common/intent-format.md, prefs references/common/layout-cards/) → node scripts/layout-generator.js layout-intent.json <dir> → diagram.json → node scripts/optimize-wiring.js <dir> --dry-run → wokwi.toml
2. ./scripts/compile.sh <dir>
3. Simulate: 工具面降级树(无死路) — VS Code+插件 → Mode B (F1)。Playwright MCP → Mode A 主路径 (monaco-steps.md)。无 MCP 但 node+playwright 已装/用户同意装 → node scripts/wokwi-automate.js。内置浏览器仅轻量操作、失败 2 次即降级。都不可达 → Mode C 手动导入(web-import/ 三件套:sketch.ino 合并版+diagram.json+libraries.txt;用户开 wokwi.com/projects/new 替换两文件、加库、点 Start)。**HARD RULE: 未经同意绝不装 playwright/npm;视觉验证只能由 Wokwi 本体满足,自绘图不得进验证结论;门不可达 → 如实 UNVERIFIED + Mode C**
4. Verify: present wiring text summary (from diagram.json, by component, exact pins, D prefix for ESP32) then confirm with user
5. arduino-cli board list → **先向用户展示端口/板型/FQBN 并确认**，再 upload。**HARD RULE: 禁止静默上传**。CH340 克隆板 Unknown 属正常，用 --fqbn arduino:avr:uno
6. --monitor for serial capture

## Hardware Check (before physical wiring)

After sim passes, before wiring: checklist simulated vs physical model; flag interface diffs (OLED I2C/SPI).
If differs: offer (A) regenerate for physical part (B) use matching part. Warn BEFORE: new sim may show anomalies (simulator limitation, not bug).

## Design Rules

- Script fail → monaco-steps.md fallback, no retry
- Script = fill+click only, agent generates content

## Self-Healing

On activation, restore missing scripts/references from GitHub:
```bash
BASE="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YuchengCai/Skill-HardwarEasySim-Wokwi/main"
for F in scripts/compile.sh scripts/wokwi-automate.js scripts/layout-generator.js scripts/optimize-wiring.js references/monaco-steps.md references/arduino/components.md references/arduino/index.json references/arduino/experience.json references/arduino/code-mapping.json references/common/intent-format.md references/common/layout-rules.md references/common/generic-wiring.md references/common/breadboard.md references/common/waypoints.md references/common/geometry.json references/common/pins.json references/common/sizes.json references/common/layout-cards/index.md references/common/layout-cards/led.md references/common/layout-cards/resistor.md references/common/layout-cards/pushbutton.md references/common/layout-cards/dht22.md references/common/layout-cards/oled.md references/common/layout-cards/buzzer.md; do
  [ -f "$F" ] || { mkdir -p "$(dirname "$F")"; curl -fsSL "$BASE/$F" -o "$F"; }
done
```

## Version Check

v0.5.0 | Repo: https://github.com/YuchengCai/Skill-HardwarEasySim-Wokwi.git

On activation:
```bash
curl -s --connect-timeout 3 https://api.github.com/repos/YuchengCai/Skill-HardwarEasySim-Wokwi/releases/latest | grep "tag_name"
```
If newer, ask user → auto update: `git clone + install.sh --global` (use --global unless user wants project-only).
